  {
    "@id": "_:N3049fd6fc84142afa19cc613b63110ed",
    "@type": [
      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/ProvenanceStatement"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Population per address (UPRN) from the GB-Census-Population-Map project (Census 2021 postcode totals shared over ONS UPRN Directory addresses inside buildings). Public green space: OS Open Zoomstack parcels of public types (parks, playing fields, play spaces, allotments, other sports facilities), touching parcels merged into sites and sites under 0.5 ha dropped. Distances are straight-line, from address points to site boundaries. Greenness: Sentinel-2 L2A from Microsoft Planetary Computer, the clearest eight days of June to August 2024, cloud-masked with the scene classification layer, median NDVI at 20 m. Boundaries: ONS LAD May 2025 and LSOA December 2021, generalised (BGC)."
      }
    ]
  },
